      "created_at": "2011-08-23T17:47:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Anyone have any ideas for the best way to store the game?  The box it came in is pretty, but if I take it anywhere I know the cards will get all messy and need sorting before we can play.  I’m hesitant to use rubber bands, because I don’t like to take the chance of bending, creasing or crimping any of them.  I like all my games to stay in pristine condition, as well as stay organized.  Is there some kind of clear box or sleeve anyone uses than can accomodate the various sized decks?</p>\n<p>It’s a minor thing.  Just curious.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
